# Early Warning Joe Liturgy meter (ARCH-05, N12) and CQC sequences (ARCH-06, N13).

# meter
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-alert-name = Liturgy
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-alert-desc = The rite builds with every blow, shove and grip that lands, and fades the moment you stop. Each stack quickens your strikes and sheds slows faster. At five you are Exalted: your next close-quarters move or sequence is the full rite. Being stunned or knocked down ends it.
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-exalted-others = The eyes of {THE($joe)} burn to a white-orange glare.
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-sequence = {$name}!
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-unmaking = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))} reels as the machine unmakes the air around it.

# level-up listing
cmu-ew-joe-level-new-sequences = New sequences: {$sequences}.

# status panel
cmu-ew-joe-status-tab-signal = SIGNAL
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-tab = LITURGY
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-header = > LITURGY // CLOSE-QUARTERS SEQUENCES
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-explain = Land each step on the same body, no more than a breath apart. Sequences are free: they cost no Liturgy, only the right inputs. When Exalted, the next sequence with a fuller form (Rebuke, Profane, Penance) plays it.
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-entry = {$name}
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-entry-blade = {$name} [BLADE]
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-none = No sequence is open to you yet.
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-locked = {$count} more {$count ->
    [one] sequence opens
   *[other] sequences open
} as you rise.
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-input-hit = Strike
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-input-wide = Wide swing (blade)
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-input-disarm = Shove
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-input-grab = Grab
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-input-aggressivegrab = Hard grip
cmu-ew-joe-liturgy-input-ability = Hands move

# sequences
cmu-ew-joe-sequence-rebuke = Rebuke
cmu-ew-joe-sequence-rebuke-hint = Takes their legs out from under them.
cmu-ew-joe-sequence-seize = Seize
cmu-ew-joe-sequence-seize-hint = The shove becomes a hard grip at once, with no warning lurch.
cmu-ew-joe-sequence-profane = Profane
cmu-ew-joe-sequence-profane-hint = Desecrates the body you just took hold of.
cmu-ew-joe-sequence-penance = Penance
cmu-ew-joe-sequence-penance-hint = Slams them into the nearest wall, table or barricade.
cmu-ew-joe-sequence-silence = Silence
cmu-ew-joe-sequence-silence-hint = Opens a choke on the body in your grip.
cmu-ew-joe-sequence-unmaking = Unmaking
cmu-ew-joe-sequence-unmaking-hint = Dazes everyone in a short cone and floors your target. Requires a blade: fists cannot wide-swing.
